							<table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr><td class="ContentBoxBody"> <div align="center"><font color="#0000ff"><b>Beastlord Epic</b></font><br /> </div> The Copper Medal of War 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl – Find Historian Sharar. She gives a long talk about a tome, just say “Yes” and accept the tome. The last line says that the Khati Sha are troubled. Historian Sharar doesn’t have the whole of the info, but will tell you it has to do with the spirits.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Copper Medal of War 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl – Beastlord Guild – find Elder Animist Dumul. He will say he doesn’t trust you. Tell him that you know the Khati Sha are disturbed about the spiritual realm. You will need to bring him a Copper Medal of War.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Copper Medal of War 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Grimling Forest – Scout Husam at the outpost – he will ask for about 6 people of his level to wipe out a grimling camp. Grimling Forest - Purchase a polished Acrylia Sphere from the nearby shopkeeper to start the quest, and follow Scout Husam to the camp. Keep him alive thru the waves of grimlings. The ‘boss’ mob will drop the Copper Medal of War.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Copper Medal of War 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl - Elder Animist Dumul. Turn in the Copper Medal of War. When you hand it in, he hands you an Official Seal of the Khati Sha and a Carved Wooden Crate. (If you lose the seal at any point, return to him and state that you have lost the seal). State that you are [ready to be briefed]. He speaks of a magic-user that is using wooden totems to siphon the power of elder spirits using [new magic]. He is using this power to summon entities of malign intent. He then states that through further research, they (the Khati Sha) have discovered the name of the magic-user.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The scouts appear to spawn about 36 hours after a patch, or about three days after their previous spawn. When you hand in a Totem looted from the Spirit you just had slain, the scout will despawn right away after handing you the Wrapped Totem. Permafrost - Scout Janomin, (just inside entrance) Hand him the seal, and the Mob: The Icebound Spirit will spawn. Kill it, and loot: Ice Bear Totem Turn it in to Scout Janomin and he will return it to you protected for travel, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Feerrott - Scout Ahlikal, (+374, -2440) Hand the seal to him and the Mob: The Spirit of Decay will spawn. Kill it, and loot: Spider Totem. Turn that in to the Scout and receive the totem back, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Lesser Faydark - Scout Rahjiq, (+185, -1885) Hand the seal to the scout and the Mob: The Spirit of Malevolence will spawn. Kill it and loot: Wolf Totem. Turn that in to the Scout and receive the totem back, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Emerald Jungle - Scout Vyrak, (+237, +4212) Hand the seal to the scout and the mob: The Spirit of Rage will spawn. Kill it and loot: Gorilla Totem. Turn that in to the Scout and receive the totem back, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Swamp of No Hope - Scout Eyru, (-3514, +2340) Hand the seal to the scout and the mob: The Spirit of Sorrow will spawn. Kill it and loot: Alligator Totem. Turn that in to the Scout and receive the totem back, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Stonebrunt Mountains - Scout Malom, (+3650, -3530) Hand the seal to the scout and the mob: The Spirit of Torment will spawn. Kill it and loot: Totem of the Watcher Turn that in to the Scout and receive the totem back, put it into the Carved Wooden Crate. When all 6 totems are in the Crate, hit combine.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Spirit Totems 7</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl - Elder Animist Dumul – Turn in the Crate (after combine).</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Timerous Deep - Scout Sihmoj – hand him the seal and he will direct you to a nearby island and hand you a bag to put the ‘loot’.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Timerous Deep - Draz Nurakk spawns in the small ruins on the opposite isle. Kill him. He'll drop nothing but his death will spawn six Iksars named "Draz Nurakks Image." The ensuing fight is handled easily with 24 people. Each of these images dropped "Shards of Broken Glass." Combine the shards in the pouch given by the Scout. Return to the Scout, and he will direct you to take them all to Elder Animist Dumul.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 3</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl – Elder Animist Dumul – hand in the bag, and get a note to take to Arms Historian Qua.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 4</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl - Arms Historian Qua (-176.79, 52.26, -188.25) . Give him the note, and he will send you to Weapons Master Rahoul with a receipt.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 5</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl - Weapons Master Rahoul (-105.99, -540.14, -258.75) Hand in the receipt. He will send you out to get 3 items for the weapons and to combine them in the box he gives.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 6</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Deep – Shriekers – kill them till you get a Chunk of dense fungal padding</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 7</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Grey - Stonehands or Stone Beasts – loot A Large Chunk of Perfect Acrylia Ore</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 8</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">The Maiden’s Eye – “Xi Xaui" and "Xi Vius" – loot Two Gems of the Void</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 9</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Combine the Chunk of Dense Fungal Padding, Two Gems of the Void, and the Large Chunk of Perfect Acrylia Ore in the box.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 10</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl - Weapons Master Rahoul – Turn the box in to him, and get the claws.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk 11</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl – Elder Animist Dumal – show claws to him and get box and seal (from before?)</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk - Epic Conclusion 1</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Fungus Grove - Scout Halimia – hand in the seal and this will spawn Draz Nurakk. Kill him and loot the head. Put it in the box with your claws and the seal. Hit combine.</td></tr></tbody> </table> <hr id="null" /> <table class="ContentBox" width="100%"> <tbody><tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Draz Nurakk - Epic Conclusion 2</td></tr> <tr> <td class="ContentBoxBody">Shar Vahl – Elder Animist Dumal hand in the combined box with the claws, head and seal. Receive Claw(s) of the Savage Spirit.</td></tr></tbody> </table> 
							
